# slug: ch64-discover
# source: chapters/ch64.tex:128
# label: alg:ch64-discover
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch64.tex:131
# caption: Discover control flow while retaining unresolved behavior.

REQUIRE immutable code image, trusted entry set, instruction semantics
ENSURE discovered instruction graph and explicit unresolved exits
initialize worklist with entries and an empty visited set
WHILE the worklist is nonempty DO
  remove address a; skip it if already visited
  decode and lift at a, or record a decoding failure
  record direct successors and soundly established indirect successors
  IF some possible successor remains unresolved THEN
    retain an unknown exit with the required machine-state contract
  END IF
  enqueue unvisited known successors
END WHILE

